<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Black eyes sale of Fairfax stake-paper.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Black eyes sale of Fairfax stake-paper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian media mogul Conrad Black is believed to be preparing to sell his 25 percent stake in Australian newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd, The Australian newspaper said.</p>
<p>&quot;Mr Black's Australian stockbroker Ord Minnett is understood to be making confidential soundings of fund managers who may be prepared to buy Fairfax shares,&quot; The Australian said.</p>
</text>
